            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Topic 2 mein tumne dekha ki kisi Relation mein ek hi input se do-do arrows nikal sakte hain (jaise 4 → −2 aur 4 → +2), aur koi input bina arrow ke bhi chhoot sakta hai. Par science, programming aur Maths ko ek **bharosemand machine** chahiye — jahan har input dene par **pakka aur sirf ek** output mile! Aise khaas relation ko hi **Function** kehte hain. Is topic mein hum Function ko pehchanna seekhenge aur 7 sabse mashhoor real functions aur unke graphs se milenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 2 mein tumne dekha ki kisi Relation mein ek hi input se do-do arrows nikal sakte hain (jaise 4 → −2 aur 4 → +2), aur koi input bina arrow ke bhi chhoot sakta hai. Par science, programming aur Maths ko ek **bharosemand machine** chahiye — jahan har input dene par **pakka aur sirf ek** output mile! Aise khaas relation ko hi **Function** kehte hain. Is topic mein hum Function ko pehchanna seekhenge aur 7 sabse mashhoor real functions aur unke graphs se milenge."
