        "summaryHinglish": "Topic 3 mein humne ek-ek standard function (x², 1/x, |x|, [x]) ko alag-alag dekha. Par asli Maths aur Physics mein hum in functions ko milakar naye functions banate hain — jaise f(x) + g(x) ya f(x)/g(",
