            "bodyHinglish": "Jab f(x) aur f(1 - x) ya f(x) aur f(1/x) ek equation mein hon:\n- x ko **(1 - x)** ya **(1/x)** se replace karke **doosri equation** banao!\n- Dono simultaneous equations solve karke f(1 - x) ya f(1/x) eliminate karo — seedha **f(x)** mil jata hai!"
