            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne dekha ki koi bhi real number **x** (chahe positive ho, negative ho ya 1000 ho) ek angle (x radians) ko dikha sakta hai. Par right triangle mein 150° ya −30° ka kona to ban nahi sakta! Phir sin 150° ya cos(−30°) kaise define honge? Is topic mein hum **Unit Circle** (radius = 1) ki madad se har real number x ke liye chhahon trigonometric functions define karenge, unke quadrants mein signs (**ASTC rule**), allied angles, aur unke **Domain, Range aur Periodic Graphs** seekhenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein humne dekha ki koi bhi real number **x** (chahe positive ho, negative ho ya 1000 ho) ek angle (x radians) ko dikha sakta hai. Par right triangle mein 150° ya −30° ka kona to ban nahi sakta! Phir sin 150° ya cos(−30°) kaise define honge? Is topic mein hum **Unit Circle** (radius = 1) ki madad se har real number x ke liye chhahon trigonometric functions define karenge, unke quadrants mein signs (**ASTC rule**), allied angles, aur unke **Domain, Range aur Periodic Graphs** seekhenge."
