            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle paanch topics mein tumne Trigonometry ko 0°–90° ke right triangle se nikaal kar ek poori real-number duniya mein badal diya: radians aur arc length (Topic 1), unit circle, ASTC aur graphs (Topic 2), compound angles (Topic 3), double/triple/half/C–D identities (Topic 4), aur trig equations (Topic 5). Ab aakhri padaav: asli exam aur Physics problems mein ye sab **ek saath** aate hain! Is topic mein hum ek **Decision Map** banayenge, 6 mixed problems (jinme classical a cos x + b sin x = c technique bhi shamil hai!) hal karenge, 3 aakhri galtiyon se bachenge, 12 mixed practice sawaal lagayenge, aur ant mein poore chapter ka saar ek table mein dekhenge."
