            "bodyHinglish": "- **Degrees ↔ Radians:** π rad = 180°, **l = rθ** (θ in radians).\n- **Unit circle & ASTC:** Quadrant sign + allied angles + periodic graphs.\n- **Compound, Multiple, C–D:** Saare formulas cos(x + y) se jude hain; 3–4 terms mein symmetric pairing karo.\n- **Equations:** Factor (never cancel), principal in [0, 2π), general with n ∈ Z; **a cos x + b sin x = c** ko √(a² + b²) se bhaag do."
