            "bodyHinglish": "Yaad karo Class 9 mein numbers ka parivaar kaise bada hota gaya tha: jab x + 3 = 1 hal nahi hua to negative integers aaye; jab 2x = 5 hal nahi hua to rational numbers aaye; jab x² = 2 hal nahi hua to irrational numbers aaye aur poori real number line **R** ban gayi! Par Class 10 mein ek deewar saamne aa khadi hui: **x² + 1 = 0**, yaani **x² = −1**. Kisi bhi real number ka square negative nahi ho sakta! Is pehle topic mein hum isi deewar ko todkar ek naya number **i = √(−1)** laayenge aur **Complex Numbers (C)** ka poora algebra seekhenge."
