            "body": "Topic 2 mein tumne ek akeli 2-variable inequality (jaise 2x + y ≥ 6) ka half-plane shade karna seekha. Par asli zindagi ke faislon mein kabhi ek hi shart nahi hoti — factory, transport, budget ya khane ki planning mein **3, 4 ya 5 shartein ek saath** maanni padti hain! Jab kai linear inequalities ek saath di hon, to unhe **System of Linear Inequalities** kehte hain, aur un sabhi half-planes ka **common (overlap) hissa** hi solution region (**Feasible Region**) hota hai. Is topic mein hum 2D systems ko solve karna, unke **corner points (vertices)** nikaalna, aur bounded, unbounded aur empty regions ko pehchanna seekhenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 2 mein tumne ek akeli 2-variable inequality (jaise 2x + y ≥ 6) ka half-plane shade karna seekha. Par asli zindagi ke faislon mein kabhi ek hi shart nahi hoti — factory, transport, budget ya khane ki planning mein **3, 4 ya 5 shartein ek saath** maanni padti hain! Jab kai linear inequalities ek saath di hon, to unhe **System of Linear Inequalities** kehte hain, aur un sabhi half-planes ka **common (overlap) hissa** hi solution region (**Feasible Region**) hota hai. Is topic mein hum 2D systems ko solve karna, unke **corner points (vertices)** nikaalna, aur bounded, unbounded aur empty regions ko pehchanna seekhenge."
