        "summaryHinglish": "Topic 2 mein har jagah kram (order) maayne rakhta tha: shabd ROSE aur SORE alag-alag words hain! Par ab socho: agar 5 doston mein se 3 ki ek committee ya cricket team chunni ho, to kya \"{A, B, C}\" aur",
