            "heading": "Quick Recap",
            "headingHinglish": "Quick Recap",
            "body": "- **NGT of (a + b)ⁿ:** m = (n + 1)|b/a| / (1 + |b/a|). Non-integer => T_{[m]+1}; Integer => Tₘ and Tₘ₊₁.\n- **Multinomial:** [n! / (r₁!...rₖ!)] x₁^(r₁)...xₖ^(rₖ); total terms = ⁿ⁺ᵏ⁻¹Cₖ₋₁.\n- **Key Binomial Series:** Σ r ⁿCᵣ = n · 2ⁿ⁻¹; Σ r² ⁿCᵣ = n(n + 1) 2ⁿ⁻²; Σ (ⁿCᵣ)² = ²ⁿCₙ.\n- **Remainder Trick:** Convert base power to (multiple of d ± 1) and expand!",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **NGT of (a + b)ⁿ:** m = (n + 1)|b/a| / (1 + |b/a|). Non-integer => T_{[m]+1}; Integer => Tₘ and Tₘ₊₁.\n- **Multinomial:** [n! / (r₁!...rₖ!)] x₁^(r₁)...xₖ^(rₖ); total terms = ⁿ⁺ᵏ⁻¹Cₖ₋₁.\n- **Key Binomial Series:** Σ r ⁿCᵣ = n · 2ⁿ⁻¹; Σ r² ⁿCᵣ = n(n + 1) 2ⁿ⁻²; Σ (ⁿCᵣ)² = ²ⁿCₙ.\n- **Remainder Trick:** Convert base power to (multiple of d ± 1) and expand!"
