            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Class 10 ke [arithmetic-progressions.md](../../../class10/maths/arithmetic-progressions/arithmetic-progressions.md) mein tumne dekha tha ki jab har agla number ek fixed constant jodne se banta hai, to use Arithmetic Progression (AP) kehte hain. Wahan tumne n-th term ka formula aₙ = a + (n - 1)d aur n terms ke sum ka formula Sₙ = (n/2)[2a + (n - 1)d] seekha tha. \n\nPar Class 11 mein hum ek kadam aage badhenge! Sequences aur Series ke beech ka buniyadi fark kya hai? Sigma notation (Σ) se lambi sums ko kaise compact roop mein likhte hain? Aur sabse dilchasp: do numbers ke beech ek nahi, balki 4, 5 ya n **Arithmetic Means** kaise insert kiye jaate hain, aur unka jod single mean ke n guna kyun hota hai? Chalo shuru karte hain!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Class 10 ke [arithmetic-progressions.md](../../../class10/maths/arithmetic-progressions/arithmetic-progressions.md) mein tumne dekha tha ki jab har agla number ek fixed constant jodne se banta hai, to use Arithmetic Progression (AP) kehte hain. Wahan tumne n-th term ka formula aₙ = a + (n - 1)d aur n terms ke sum ka formula Sₙ = (n/2)[2a + (n - 1)d] seekha tha. \n\nPar Class 11 mein hum ek kadam aage badhenge! Sequences aur Series ke beech ka buniyadi fark kya hai? Sigma notation (Σ) se lambi sums ko kaise compact roop mein likhte hain? Aur sabse dilchasp: do numbers ke beech ek nahi, balki 4, 5 ya n **Arithmetic Means** kaise insert kiye jaate hain, aur unka jod single mean ke n guna kyun hota hai? Chalo shuru karte hain!"
