            "body": "Line L(x, y) ≡ Ax + By + C = 0 coordinate plane ko do half-planes mein baantti hai:\n- Do points P(x₁, y₁) aur Q(x₂, y₂) line ke **SAME side** par hain iff **L(x₁, y₁) · L(x₂, y₂) > 0** (dono ka sign same!).\n- **OPPOSITE sides** par hain iff **L(x₁, y₁) · L(x₂, y₂) < 0** (signs opposite!).",
            "bodyHinglish": "Line L(x, y) ≡ Ax + By + C = 0 coordinate plane ko do half-planes mein baantti hai:\n- Do points P(x₁, y₁) aur Q(x₂, y₂) line ke **SAME side** par hain iff **L(x₁, y₁) · L(x₂, y₂) > 0** (dono ka sign same!).\n- **OPPOSITE sides** par hain iff **L(x₁, y₁) · L(x₂, y₂) < 0** (signs opposite!)."
