            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Ellipse mein kisi bhi point P se do foci F₁ aur F₂ ki dooriyon ka **sum (PF₁ + PF₂)** constant tha. Ab bas ek sign badal do — **plus (+) ki jagah minus (-)**!\n\nAgar kisi point P se do fixed foci F₁ aur F₂ ki dooriyon ka **difference (|PF₁ - PF₂| = 2a)** hamesha constant rahe, to band oval ki jagah do aamne-saamne khuli hui symmetric branches banti hain — jise **Hyperbola** kehte hain! Chalo iska math derive karte hain aur dekhte hain ki yeh Ellipse se kahan milta hai aur kahan bilkul alag ho jata hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ellipse mein kisi bhi point P se do foci F₁ aur F₂ ki dooriyon ka **sum (PF₁ + PF₂)** constant tha. Ab bas ek sign badal do — **plus (+) ki jagah minus (-)**!\n\nAgar kisi point P se do fixed foci F₁ aur F₂ ki dooriyon ka **difference (|PF₁ - PF₂| = 2a)** hamesha constant rahe, to band oval ki jagah do aamne-saamne khuli hui symmetric branches banti hain — jise **Hyperbola** kehte hain! Chalo iska math derive karte hain aur dekhte hain ki yeh Ellipse se kahan milta hai aur kahan bilkul alag ho jata hai!"
