            "heading": "Part C: Director Circle & Hyperbola Asymptotes",
            "headingHinglish": "Part C: Director Circle & Hyperbola Asymptotes",
            "body": "1. **Director Circle** (woh locus jahan se conic par kheenchhi gayi dono tangents **90° par perpendicular** hoti hain!):\n   - Circle x² + y² = r² => **x² + y² = 2r²**\n   - Parabola y² = 4ax => **x = -a** (Directrix hi Director Circle hai!)\n   - Ellipse x²/a² + y²/b² = 1 => **x² + y² = a² + b²**\n   - Hyperbola x²/a² - y²/b² = 1 => **x² + y² = a² - b²** (exists iff a > b)\n2. **Asymptotes of Hyperbola x²/a² - y²/b² = 1:**\n   RHS ko 0 rakh do: x²/a² - y²/b² = 0 => **y = ±(b/a) x**!\n   Yeh do straight lines hain jinke hyperbola ki branches infinity par behad kareeb pahunch jaati hain par kabhi kaatti nahi!",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Director Circle** (woh locus jahan se conic par kheenchhi gayi dono tangents **90° par perpendicular** hoti hain!):\n   - Circle x² + y² = r² => **x² + y² = 2r²**\n   - Parabola y² = 4ax => **x = -a** (Directrix hi Director Circle hai!)\n   - Ellipse x²/a² + y²/b² = 1 => **x² + y² = a² + b²**\n   - Hyperbola x²/a² - y²/b² = 1 => **x² + y² = a² - b²** (exists iff a > b)\n2. **Asymptotes of Hyperbola x²/a² - y²/b² = 1:**\n   RHS ko 0 rakh do: x²/a² - y²/b² = 0 => **y = ±(b/a) x**!\n   Yeh do straight lines hain jinke hyperbola ki branches infinity par behad kareeb pahunch jaati hain par kabhi kaatti nahi!"
