            "body": "Class 9 ke [probability.md](../../../class9/maths/probability/probability.md) mein tumne simple coins aur dice ke liye \"favourable outcomes / total outcomes\" nikaala tha.\n\nClass 11 mein hum Probability ko ek **rigorous mathematical foundation (Set Theory)** par khada karte hain! Yahan har possible result ko ek set (**Sample Space S**) mein rakha jata hai, aur har sawal ko us set ka ek **subset (Event)** bana diya jata hai — jisse Chapter 1 ke sabhi Set Theory laws (Union, Intersection, Complement, De Morgan) seedhe Probability par kaam karne lagte hain!",
