            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Class 9 mein tumne seedha formula padha tha: P(A) = favourable / total. Lekin agar koi coin biased (jhuka hua) ho jisme Head aane ka chance 70% aur Tail ka 30% ho, to wahan \"favourable / total\" (1/2) bilkul galat answer dega!\n\nIsliye Russian mathematician **Andrey Kolmogorov** ne 1933 mein **Axiomatic Approach to Probability** diya — sirf 3 simple rules (axioms) jo fair coins par bhi kaam karte hain, biased dice par bhi, aur real-world weather models par bhi! Chalo in teen axioms ko samjhte hain!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Class 9 mein tumne seedha formula padha tha: P(A) = favourable / total. Lekin agar koi coin biased (jhuka hua) ho jisme Head aane ka chance 70% aur Tail ka 30% ho, to wahan \"favourable / total\" (1/2) bilkul galat answer dega!\n\nIsliye Russian mathematician **Andrey Kolmogorov** ne 1933 mein **Axiomatic Approach to Probability** diya — sirf 3 simple rules (axioms) jo fair coins par bhi kaam karte hain, biased dice par bhi, aur real-world weather models par bhi! Chalo in teen axioms ko samjhte hain!"
