            "heading": "Part A: Complement Rule — Derivation (\"Kyun\"!)",
            "headingHinglish": "Part A: Complement Rule — Derivation (\"Kyun\"!)",
            "body": "Kisi bhi event A aur uske complement A' ke liye:\nA ∪ A' = S   aur   A ∩ A' = φ (mutually exclusive!).\n\nAxioms 2 aur 3 se:\nP(A) + P(A') = P(S) = 1\n=> **P(A') = 1 - P(A)**   aur   **P(A) = 1 - P(A')**.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Kisi bhi event A aur uske complement A' ke liye:\nA ∪ A' = S   aur   A ∩ A' = φ (mutually exclusive!).\n\nAxioms 2 aur 3 se:\nP(A) + P(A') = P(S) = 1\n=> **P(A') = 1 - P(A)**   aur   **P(A) = 1 - P(A')**."
