            "headingHinglish": "Part C: De Morgan's Probability Laws Aur \"Only A\"",
            "body": "Chapter 1 ([sets-part3.md](../sets/sets-part3.md)) ke De Morgan's Laws se:\n1. **P(neither A nor B)** = P(A' ∩ B') = P((A ∪ B)') = **1 - P(A ∪ B)**\n2. **P(not both A and B)** = P(A' ∪ B') = P((A ∩ B)') = **1 - P(A ∩ B)**\n3. **P(A but not B / only A)** = P(A ∩ B') = **P(A) - P(A ∩ B)**\n4. **P(B but not A / only B)** = P(B ∩ A') = **P(B) - P(A ∩ B)**\n5. **P(exactly one of A or B)** = P(A ∩ B') + P(B ∩ A') = **P(A) + P(B) - 2 P(A ∩ B)**",
            "bodyHinglish": "Chapter 1 ([sets-part3.md](../sets/sets-part3.md)) ke De Morgan's Laws se:\n1. **P(neither A nor B)** = P(A' ∩ B') = P((A ∪ B)') = **1 - P(A ∪ B)**\n2. **P(not both A and B)** = P(A' ∪ B') = P((A ∩ B)') = **1 - P(A ∩ B)**\n3. **P(A but not B / only A)** = P(A ∩ B') = **P(A) - P(A ∩ B)**\n4. **P(B but not A / only B)** = P(B ∩ A') = **P(B) - P(A ∩ B)**\n5. **P(exactly one of A or B)** = P(A ∩ B') + P(B ∩ A') = **P(A) + P(B) - 2 P(A ∩ B)**"
